Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: MediaTek BlueAngel stack for the MT6620 (vee4ss)

The MT6620 is driven through WMT/STP, /dev/stpbt and the stock mtkbt
daemon, not BlueZ/rfkill. BlueAngel versions of BluetoothService,
BluetoothEventLoop, A2DP, socket and audio gateway JNI, the profile
manager and socket Binder services, the extra profile APIs (built into
framework2.jar), SystemServer registration and the servicemanager
entries for the mtk.bt.profile.*.ashm services. libandroid_runtime builds
the BlueAngel parts only with BOARD_HAVE_BLUETOOTH_MTK (__BTMTK__) and
takes cutils/xlog.h from device/lge/mt6575-common/include.

---
