+/*****************************************************************************
+ * FUNCTION
+ *  btmtk_paired_dev_cache_init
+ * DESCRIPTION
+ *  Read all paired device cache data from file
+ * PARAMETERS
+ *  void
+ * RETURNS
+ *  void
